    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1412">

                <pb facs="0933" n="817" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg817"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.52/308.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Spanish Ambassador to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translations.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Spanish Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-06-02">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 2, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Secretary</hi>: I hasten to apprize your
                    excellency that I have received telegraphic instructions from the Government of
                    His Majesty the King, my August Sovereign, directing me to apply to your
                    excellency for your good offices to prevent the Constitutionalists from
                    enforcing the loan of 500,000 pesos they demand of the Spaniards at Tampico.</p>
                <p>I am carding out those instructions in asking that you will bring all your
                    influence to bear in order to prevent the consummation of this fresh outrage on
                    my fellow countrymen and I am sure that His Majesty’s Government will highly
                    appreciate such action as your excellency may see fit to take to that end.</p>
                <p>I avail [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Juan Riaño</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
